#: kcmkded.cpp:75
msgid "Startup Services"
msgstr "Gwasanaethau Cychwyn"

#: kcmkded.cpp:76
msgid ""
"This shows all KDE services that can be loaded on KDE startup. Checked "
"services will be invoked on next startup. Be careful with deactivation of "
"unknown services."
msgstr ""
"Dengys hwn pob gwasanaeth KDE mae modd ei lwytho wrth gychwyn KDE. "
"Fe elwir ar y gwasanaethau dewisiedig wrth gychwyn tro nesaf. Byddwch yn "
"ofalus wrth dadweithredoli gwasanaethau anhysbys."

